only (no H review) is refused\": true,\n   507\t \"an unread H row is refused\": true,\n   508\t \"an incomplete gain review is refused\": true,\n   509\t \"every gain withdrawn by its reviews: not improved, fail\": true,\n   510\t \"an H4 double count fails\": true,\n   511\t \"a linked grounding error the control lacks fails\": true,\n   512\t \"two more H5 failures in a linked sequence fail\": true,\n   513\t \"a sequence the gate rejected makes it inconclusive\": true,\n   514\t \"a linked double refusal fails even with no P rows\": true,\n   515\t \"four more linked refusals on matched reader-days fail (H1)\": true,\n   516\t \"three more are tolerated (H1)\": true,\n   517\t \"a material failure without a reliance finding is refused\": true,\n   518\t \"a substituted P judgement is refused\": true,\n   519\t \"pilot: a complete reading of an improved pair continues\": true,\n   520\t \"pilot: never gives the comparison's pass\": true,\n   521\t \"pilot: a substituted P judgement is refused\": true,\n   522\t \"pilot: a missing H4 reading is refused\": true,\n   523\t \"pilot: an H4 double count stops\": true,\n   524\t \"pilot: a quantified CPU correction is applied per gain date (the gains become definite: stop)\": true,\n   525\t \"pilot: every unquantifiable CPU gain unresolved together (stop: undecided)\": true\n   526\t}\n   527\texit 0\n     1\t{\n     2\t \"mutant\": \"window cut short\",\n     3\t \"check expected to fail\": \"calendar completed (every day old-2 completed)\",\n     4\t \"caught\": true,\n     5\t \"stopped\": \"\",\n     6\t \"acceptance\": {\n     7\t  \"window completed, no stop\": true,\n     8\t  \"calendar completed (every day old-2 completed)\": false,\n     9\t  \"committed graph equals the pinned one (labels included)\": true,\n    10\t  \"probe jobs consumed exactly the pinned set\": true,\n    11\t  \"every post-link reader judgement fresh on its own day\": true,\n    12\t  \"every pre-link reader judgement from the archive\": true,\n    13\t  \"reader judgements present\": true,\n    14\t  \"upstream snapshot clean\": true,\n    15\t  \"upstream snapshot exercised (linked)\": true,\n    16\t  \"fixed trajectory (H2)\": false,\n    17\t  \"ledger clean (not stopped, no overrun)\": true,\n    18\t  \"accepted\": false\n    19\t }\n    20\t}\n    21\texit 0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
